{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach visible object - take, weigh, move and check - perform specific task or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedLocation    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTaskSubTree    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
